title: Kid
---
<<if is_upset("Kid")>>
    <<jump Kid_Upset>>
<<elseif quest_status("amethyst") == "NotStarted">>
    <<jump Kid_Ask>>
<<elseif quest_status("amethyst") == "Active" and quest_ready("amethyst")>>
    <<jump Kid_Deliver>>
<<elseif quest_status("amethyst") == "Active">>
    <<jump Kid_Waiting>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Kid_Done>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Kid_Ask
---
Kid: HEY THERE SIR

-> why are you screaming
    Mc: why are you screaming
-> ……..
    Mc: ……..
-> HEY THERE KIDDO
    Mc: HEY THERE KIDDO

Kid: SIR I NEED SOMETHING FROM YOU SIR
Mc: …..
Kid: HERE TAKE THIS

<<give_item "bugs_and_rocks" 1>>

Kid: I'D LIKE SOME AMETHYST SIR

-> this won't get you an amethyst
    Mc: this won't get you an amethyst
-> why
    Mc: why
-> …..
    Mc: …..

Kid: I'LL STOP BY TO TAKE IT LATER SIR THANN YOU

<<start_quest "amethyst">>
===

title: Kid_Waiting
---
Kid: DID YOU GET IT YET SIR?
Mc: …..
Kid: I'LL COME BACK LATER SIR
===

title: Kid_Deliver
---
Kid: HELLO SIR
Kid: GOT THE AMETHYSTINE SIR?

-> Here you go
    Mc: Here you go
-> ….
    Mc: ….
-> yes but why'd a kid like you want one?
    Mc: yes but why'd a kid like you want one?

<<complete_quest "amethyst">>

Kid: I..
Kid: Thank you sir I
Mc: what?
Kid: it's my mom… she's sick and they told us we need an amethyst for her medicine
Kid: I will come here again with my mom to thank you SIR THANK YOUUU!!
===

title: Kid_Done
---
Kid: THANK YOU AGAIN SIR!
